Package: jamses
Title: Jam SummarizedExperiment Stats
Version: 0.0.80.900
Authors@R: person(given="James M.", family="Ward",
   email="jmw86069@gmail.com", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Methods to analyze SummarizedExperiment data,
   define experiment design, visualize the experiment design,
   normalize assay data, define statistical contrasts, and
   perform differential analysis (via other packages).
   S7 object 'SEDesign' enforces relationship between
   individual samples, design groups, and groups involved
   in statistical contrasts. S7 object 'SEStats' stores
   multiple contrasts in one object, to apply cutoffs
   and summarize altogether.
